j=A.P8("Movement & Physical Recovery",A.a(["Do you offer home visits or clinic visits in Ahmedabad?","How many sessions a week are typically helpful initially?","Will you train family members on safe transfer techniques?"],l),"Physiotherapists assess movement restrictions, muscle weakness, balance instability, and post-illness debility. They guide tailored physical exercises and rehabilitation strategies to restore safe mobility.","physiotherapy",k,"Physiotherapy",j,m,"Support for walking, strength, balance, mobility, and physical recovery.","The physiotherapist reviews medical history, discharge summaries, evaluates muscle power, joint range, standing balance, and walking posture. Together you set realistic mobility goals.","Helpful for weakness, joint stiffness, and difficulty walking safely at home.")
